#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#Global Vehicle Target (GVT) used in modern Euro NCAP tests, and can be used for other safety tests as well
#- has radar reflectivity
#- moves on a remote controlled and programmable flat platform/robot
#- the GVT breaks apart and can be reassembed if it is hit by another vehicle
#- the motorized flat platform can be run over, and still function
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

